bel pi-secondary-font\">Level</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">3</div>\n</div>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<table class=\"pi-horizontal-group\">\n\t\n\t\n\t<thead>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"level\">Previous</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"level\">Next</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</thead>\n\t\n\t<tbody>\n\t<tr>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"level\"><a href=\"/wiki/Not_in_Lone_Splendor\" title=\"Not in Lone Splendor\">Not in Lone Splendor</a></td>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"level\"><a href=\"/wiki/Cloudveiled_Ridges_in_Floral_Mists\" title=\"Cloudveiled Ridges in Floral Mists\">Cloudveiled Ridges in Floral Mists</a></td>\n\t\n\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-panel pi-border-color wds-tabber\">\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"wds-tabs\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDescription\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDetails\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"description\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Increases the Level of Elemental Skill <b><a href=\"/wiki/Eternal_Tides\" title=\"Eternal Tides\">Eternal Tides</a></b> by 3.<br />Maximum upgrade level is 15.<br /><br />All nearby <a href=\"/wiki/Party\" title=\"Party\">party</a> members' Lunar Reaction DMG is <span class=\"custom-tt-wrapper giw-extra-effect-wrapper toggle-tooltip mw-collapsible mw-made-collapsible mw-collapsed giw-collapsible\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible-toggle mw-collapsible-toggle-default mw-collapsible-toggle-collapsed giw-extra-effect toggle-tooltip\"><b>elevated</b></span><span class=\"mw-collapsible-content giw-extra-effect\" style=\"display:none\"><span class=\"giw-extra-effect-header\">Elevation</span><span class=\"giw-extra-effect-content\">Special DMG Boost effect. It is calculated independently of other DMG Boost effects.</span></span></span> by 1.5%.</div>\n</div>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content\">\n\t\t\t\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"utility1\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><b>Utility</b><ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Talent_Level_Increase\" title=\"Talent Level Increase\">Talent Level Increase</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/Elemental_Skill_Level_Increase\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Elemental Skill Level Increase\">Elemental Skill Level Increase</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/Lunar-Charged_DMG_Elevation\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Lunar-Charged DMG Elevation\">Lunar-Charged DMG Elevation</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/Lunar-Bloom_DMG_Elevation\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Lunar-Bloom DMG Elevation\">Lunar-Bloom DMG Elevation</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/Lunar-Crystallize_DMG_Elevation\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Lunar-Crystallize DMG Elevation\">Lunar-Crystallize DMG Elevation</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/DMG_Elevation\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"DMG Elevation\">DMG Elevation</a></li></ul></div>\n</div>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n\n</section>\n</aside>\n\n<b>Dreamlike Glow Across Tranquil Waters</b> is <a href=\"/wiki/Columbina\" title